  "description": "Designed for riders favoring high XC performance and fast rolling 29\" wheels, the 29\" FLC Pro features incredibly light Sram X01 drivetrain, Guide RS disc brakes, RockShox Reba RL fork and Ritchey components. There is no Haro in existence packing more speed potential than the FLC 29\" Pro.\n2016 Haro FL Carbon 29.0 Series w/ tapered head tube, BB92 shell, 12mm rear Thru-Axle, Direct mount front derailleur option\nRockShox Reba RL 29.0 tapered fork, 100mm travel w/ 15m Thru-axle & Onelock remote\nRitchey WCS Logic Zero Drop-In headset, tapered 1-1/8\"-1.5\", w/ ACB sealed bearings\nSram X01 32t crankset w/ Press Fit\nSram GXP BB92 set\nSram X01 rear derailleur\nSram XG 1180 10-42T cassette & X01 Trigger 11-speed shifter\nRitchey WCS Flat handlebar, WCS stem and Lock-On grips\nRitchey WCS Streem V3 saddle & Ritchey WCS 27.2mm post\nSram Roam 30 lightweight wheelset w/ Thru-Axles, 15mm Frt / 12mm Rear\nKenda Honey Badger XC 29.0*2.05\" 120TPI folding tires\nSram Guide RS 180 / 160mm disc brakeset",
